WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.160
- Last time I was here,

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.991
Kelly also wasn't here.

00:00:04.991 --> 00:00:05.824
(audience laughs)

00:00:05.824 --> 00:00:07.410
That's weird, right?

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:08.910
It's weird.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:12.570
No one's ever seen me and Kelly
Clarkson in the same room.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:13.860
(audience laughs)

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.899
Maybe I'm her Clarkson Kent.

00:00:15.899 --> 00:00:18.390
(audience laughs)

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.180
I'm starting to think
it was something I did.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.587
Could she still be mad that
I voted for Justin Guarini?

00:00:24.587 --> 00:00:28.170
(audience boos)

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.300
I regret the decision.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.553
Every day, and especially today.

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:34.350
Last time I was here,

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:37.716
my friend Simu Liu was the guest host.

00:00:37.716 --> 00:00:39.510
(audience cheers)

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:41.610
And we played a game

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:44.460
where I was lucky enough
to drink hot dog water.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.990
Let's see that.

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:46.823
- [God] Come on, Kumail.

00:00:46.823 --> 00:00:48.357
- [Kumail] I can do this all day.

00:00:48.357 --> 00:00:49.950
(drum roll)

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:51.420
- [God] And this is hot dog water.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:52.880
- Yeah.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.819
(drum roll)

00:00:54.819 --> 00:00:56.670
- [God] That's it. Mmmm.

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:59.400
- [Simu] Boba, boba, boba's right there.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:00.720
- [God] What a lovely bouquet.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.043
Hot dog water. Mmm.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.250
Where's your superpowers now, huh?

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.083
- I give up.

00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:06.960
- Fair enough.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:08.430
- That is not a lie.

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:10.080
That is hot dog water.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.256
- [God] That is hot dog water.

00:01:12.256 --> 00:01:16.530
(audience cheers)

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:18.430
- I don't know why I keep coming back.

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:22.170
They also made me drink a cup of wasabi

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:24.240
as well as a shot of ranch dressing.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:27.300
Both things I genuinely actually despise.

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:30.903
Horrible. My stomach
still has not recovered.

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:33.360
Aw, thank you.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.280
That's so kind of you.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.420
Thank you, Justin.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:38.073
My God, this is great.

00:01:40.389 --> 00:01:43.020
(audience cheers)

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.407
Thank you.

00:01:44.407 --> 00:01:45.660
- You're welcome.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.090
- Wait, is that what
happens when you're a host?

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:50.013
You get to drink whatever you ask for.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.990
Okay, can I have a pineapple
smoothie right now?

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.340
Oh wow.

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.873
Look at that.

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:01.890
There's no whipped cream.

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:03.573
Hmm. Oh yeah.

00:02:05.059 --> 00:02:08.730
(audience cheers)

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.563
Thank you.

00:02:09.563 --> 00:02:10.733
- [Justin] You're very welcome.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.010
- Thank you so much.

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:17.310
Wow. Pepto and pineapple
don't go well together.

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:18.868
Don't ever do that.

00:02:18.868 --> 00:02:20.313
Don't ever do that.

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:24.960
Other than that, I am happy to
be covering for Kelly today.

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:27.690
She was, you know, I've
never hosted a show before.

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:30.000
This is my first time hosting any show.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.053
I've never hosted a show.

00:02:31.053 --> 00:02:32.430
(audience cheers)

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:34.890
So she was kind enough

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:38.160
to leave me a note with some hosting tips,

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.630
specially for me.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.100
So here we go.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:42.690
This is a note from Kelly.

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:43.740
Hi Kumail.

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:46.860
Thank you for taking such
good care of my show.

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:51.860
Aww. Don't get ahead of
yourself Kelly, I just started.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:53.253
Things could go south.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.760
I truly appreciate you guest hosting

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:58.170
and making Marvel movies.

00:02:58.170 --> 00:02:59.850
Oh, that's kind.

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:02.983
Here are a few tips
while you're at the show

00:03:02.983 --> 00:03:04.920
that may help you.

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:08.553
Tip number one, compliment Ruben's suit.

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:12.302
He warms up the audience

00:03:12.302 --> 00:03:14.280
(audience cheers)

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.900
and will get them extra warm

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:17.130
if you tell him he looks nice.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.540
Man, you look really nice.

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:22.047
- Give it up for me man, come on. Yeah!

00:03:22.047 --> 00:03:24.503
- That's very sharp.

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:27.840
That is very sharp.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:28.673
Well done.

00:03:28.673 --> 00:03:31.200
Tip number two, the band will play a sting

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.257
whenever you say,

00:03:32.257 --> 00:03:34.741
"Welcome to Chippendales takeover."

00:03:34.741 --> 00:03:37.080
(sting plays)

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.570
Yeah, thank you.

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:40.950
I should take you guys around.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:44.070
That's an awesome thing to
just have happen in my life.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.127
If you scream,

00:03:45.127 --> 00:03:46.830
"I'm wearing lace underwear",

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.870
something awesome happens.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.943
I'm wearing lace underwear!

00:03:53.371 --> 00:03:55.080
(audience laughs)

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.243
Just kidding about that last one.

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:00.102
Thanks a lot, Kelly.

00:04:00.102 --> 00:04:00.960
(audience cheers)

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:02.280
Thank you.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:03.540
Have fun.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.670
Another reason I'm
really excited to be here

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:09.210
is that we have many people
from the cast of my series

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:10.738
on the show today.

00:04:10.738 --> 00:04:13.320
(audience cheers)

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:16.170
The show is called
"Welcome to Chippendales",

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:18.480
and you can see it now on Hulu.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:19.320
That's right.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:22.099
This is a "Welcome to
Chippendales" takeover.

00:04:22.099 --> 00:04:24.599
(sting plays)

00:04:25.586 --> 00:04:27.090
Thank you.

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:28.980
In this series, I play Steve Banerjee

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:31.860
the Indian immigrant who
created Chippendales.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:32.693
People don't know this,

00:04:32.693 --> 00:04:34.710
the story actually gets really dark

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:36.540
which is not what you'd expect.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:39.510
There's double crossing, murder, drugs,

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:41.580
everything that's kind
of the exact opposite

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:44.133
of what you think when
you think of Chippendales.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.440
Although there are plenty

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:48.450
of nearly naked men dancing,

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.163
so that's a plus.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:55.453
Speaking of which, we have some
dancers here with us today.

00:04:55.453 --> 00:04:57.788
(audience cheers)

00:04:57.788 --> 00:04:58.621
(audience cheers)

00:04:58.621 --> 00:04:59.454
What's up fellas?

00:04:59.454 --> 00:05:00.810
How's it going?

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:03.960
Do us proud in the
Blake's Box Seats today.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:07.440
I know Blake Shelton would be
proud to have you up there.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:08.640
Thank you for being there.

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:12.570
So, are you guys okay like
showing us the moves right now?

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:14.958
Yeah? Jason, can we play some music?

00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:18.484
(upbeat music)

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:22.038
(upbeat music)

00:05:22.038 --> 00:05:25.508
(upbeat music)

00:05:25.508 --> 00:05:28.838
(upbeat music)

00:05:28.838 --> 00:05:32.180
(upbeat music)

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:35.040
(upbeat music)

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:39.647
Yeah! Yeah!

00:05:39.647 --> 00:05:40.650
(audience cheers)

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.750
I'm actually not a good dancer.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:44.580
My wife Emily will back me up on that.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:45.480
She's not here today,

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:48.660
but you know, I'm not good at dancing.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.040
I'd love to go dancing with her

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:52.953
but these video games won't
play themselves, you know?

